+## [Unreleased]
+
+### [Unreleased] - Changed
+
+- `interactiveTemperature` now applies to Ollama models only. Claude runs
+  with adaptive thinking, where the API accepts only the default
+  temperature: any other value was rejected with a 400 and silently retried
+  without it, and the default changed nothing. `cco` no longer sends a
+  temperature to Claude, and the final stage drops the temperature-free
+  retry that existed only to absorb that rejection.
+
